Build on illumos and Solaris: recognise solaris* hosts and find libsocket and
libnsl in configure, uae_s8 as int8_t, <sys/filio.h> for FIONREAD,
<sys/regset.h> for the JIT, and msgfmt options that the system msgfmt
understands.

https://github.com/FrodeSolheim/fs-uae/pull/397

